'''Combat II '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "COMB4T2." It is now only obtainable through trading as the code has since expired. 

==Appearance==
Its blade and guard are gray with minor scratches and cracks on it. The handle is tightly wrapped in green fabric.

==Trivia==
*Combat II was the very first [[Season 1]] code.
*Due to the fact [[Codes|code]] weapons were commonly [[Duping|duped]], Combat II’s release was slightly delayed.
*It's prime is [[Combat]].
*This is one of the few knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.

